1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
Your stove draws worse every burn, and you know why.

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:06,760
Soot builds up quietly, deep in the bend, where a stiff rod gets stuck.

3
00:00:06,760 --> 00:00:10,480
Poor draft, the smell stays, and a stiff brush can't reach.

4
00:00:10,480 --> 00:00:12,440
Soot in the flue means a weaker draw.

5
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:14,320
This is the chimney kit with flexible rods.

6
00:00:14,320 --> 00:00:15,600
They bend, they don't jam.

7
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:18,040
Nine rods screw together, 3.69 meters.

8
00:00:18,040 --> 00:00:20,080
3.69 meters behind the stove.

9
00:00:20,080 --> 00:00:20,840
The soot comes loose.

10
00:00:20,840 --> 00:00:22,680
Clean it yourself between sweeps.
